# Sagittarius — Layers 1 + 2
#
# Sagittarius currently takes NO environment variables. It is configured
# entirely by command-line flags, and all Polymarket endpoints it calls are
# public and unauthenticated:
#
#   --transport=http|sse|stdio   (default: http)
#   --port=8080                  (default: 8080)
#
# This file exists so the pair of repos is consistent and so the first
# variable added has an obvious home. Polymarket base URLs are injectable in
# code for tests (see internal/infrastructure/polymarket) but are deliberately
# not environment-driven in production — pointing Layer 1 at a non-Polymarket
# host should be a code change, reviewed, not a deploy-time toggle.
